                        FastCheck V1.1 coded by AtomiX / Outlaws
                        +Requester Version

WHAT'S THE USE OF THIS TOOL ?
-----------------------------

        This is a nice LHA Checker for AmiExpress or 
        S-Express or simply for the DoS on ThE Amiga

        You are able to Strip and Add and Test LHA Archives
        with Scripts . The Checker is fully Configurable

        Dont forget the .info File MUST exists

        OrginalFileLength:    FastCheck 5508bytes   [BBS & CommandLine]
        OrginalFileLength:Req-FastCheck 6260bytes   [Requester version]


HISTORY :
---------

	V1.0ß - Never Released just for fun ;))

         - Added Icon Support it's now fully Icon Configurable.
           
         - New Tooltype added for Low Memory Systems.
           Last bugs fixed..
         
   v1.0  - First official Release after 2 months beta testing.

   v1.1  - Code Optimized (1.5KB shorter haha).
           You can now Configure the Script Locations & Names.
           Test Archives is changed to Default ON.
           New Option Dont Show LHA Files (Optional)


HOW TO INSTALL :
----------------

        Copy all Drawers to your Path where you ever Like it
        it must not be Specify you can Copy FastCheck to C:
        or S: ,it's not intresting where it is located

        ToolTypes:
        ---------
        LHA_LOCATION=C:LHA        * Location for your LHA Packer   *
                                  * if not ? C:LHA is Default      *

        WORK_DIR=T:               * Path where you want to Check   *
                                  * &add the Temponary LHA File    *
                                  * for People with a lot of       *
                                  * memory (gelle Rüdiger)         *

        REMOVE=ON / OFF           * Write ON if you want to Strip  *
                                  * BBS Adverts from Archives      *

        ADVERTS=ON / OFF          * ON if you want to Add BBS Adds *

        TEST=ON / OFF             * "  "  "    "   "  Check Files  *
                                  * Default is ON                  *

        STRIP_SCRIPT=<Path&Name>  * Set the Path and Name from the *
                                  * Strip Script,Default Dir&Name  *
                                  * is "S:FastCheck.Strip"         *

        ADD_SCRIPT=<Path&Name>    * Set the Path and Name from the *
                                  * Add Script,Default Dir&Name is *
                                  * S:FastCheck.add                *
 
        DONT_DISPLAY              * When this Tooltype is set then *
                                  * the LHA Files will not shown   *

